# Concept folder contract

Every topic under `core-concepts/<slug>/` or `key-technologies/<slug>/` must include:

- `README.md` — explain the concept; **variant comparison is required**; session notes; how to run
- `docker-compose.yml` — filled when a demo exists (optional for notes-only topics)
- `scripts/setup.sh`, `scripts/stop.sh`, `scripts/run-scenarios.sh`, `scripts/run-functional.sh` — same venv rules as questions; stubs may exit 1 until prompted

No FAQ / FLOW / COMPONENTS required. Status: **Stub** / **Notes-only** / **Implemented**.

Re-practice updates the same folder (`09-update-on-repractice.mdc` spirit). Original notes only.
